            <title><![CDATA[Jared Kushner Hacked Phone Reveals Secret Negotiations, Millions in Transactions (163 pts)]]></title>
            <link>https://www.vanityfair.com/story/jared-kushner-hacked-phone-secret-negotiations</link>
