</code></pre></div>
<p dir="auto">The iOS programs, frameworks and dyld shared cache are not changed by a single byte: what they miss is done by the
kernel (driver replacements) or by a library the kernel injects with <code>DYLD_INSERT_LIBRARIES</code> (<code>kern.exec_inject</code>).</p>
