44850 — Institut de recherche pour le développement (IRD; EPST) — Public research institute working with Global South partners on health, environment and social sciences.
29110 — Institut Pasteur (private foundation, recognised as public utility) — Non-profit biomedical research foundation in Paris (infectious diseases, vaccines, microbiology); hosts national reference centres.</p>
<p><strong>Research &amp; education network</strong>
1307, 1712, 1715, 1942, 1945, 2060, 2094, 2198, 2200, 2202, 2259, 2269, 2457, 2470, 2472 — RENATER (GIP) — National research and education network; its members are the State and public research bodies.</p>
<p><strong>Student-run campus networks</strong>
