51588 — SESAN (GIP) — Île-de-France regional body providing shared digital-health services to care providers.
49692 — Compagnie Générale de Santé (SAS; private) — Name of the hospital group now called Ramsay Santé.</p>
<p><strong>Broadcast &amp; media</strong>
