57226 — IDEMIA Identity &amp; Security France (SAS) — Identity documents, biometric identification and border/access systems; formerly Safran Morpho.
41935 — Dassault Systèmes (SE; listed) — 3D design and simulation software (CATIA, SOLIDWORKS); not Dassault Aviation.
